1
00:02:01,099 --> 00:02:09,758
Visit turkision.com for more!

2
00:02:11,133 --> 00:02:13,873
I will never forgive you!
Do you understand me? Never!

3
00:02:13,873 --> 00:02:15,073
You wouldn't want that.

4
00:02:15,073 --> 00:02:17,013
But you hurt me!

5
00:02:18,886 --> 00:02:23,325
Would I hurt you, huh? You were going to
say yes to Mehmet in front of me!

6
00:02:23,486 --> 00:02:27,805
I thought you would throw
that ring at Mehmet's face!

7
00:02:27,926 --> 00:02:31,845
But what did you do,
Holofira? What did you do?

8
00:02:32,246 --> 00:02:34,805
You were almost going to say yes to Mehmet.

9
00:02:41,726 --> 00:02:46,685
Holofira... Don't you love me?

10
00:02:47,446 --> 00:02:50,605
It doesn't change anything.
You abducted me twice!

11
00:02:50,726 --> 00:02:54,765
If you do the same thing,
I will abduct you again!

12
00:02:54,846 --> 00:02:59,685
Orhan! You don't understand!
You don't see the truth!

13
00:02:59,726 --> 00:03:04,085
-Come on, tell me! Tell me! What am I missing?
-The truth is...

14
00:03:04,086 --> 00:03:08,045
...our lives are different!

15
00:03:11,086 --> 00:03:14,765
There is only one truth in my life.

16
00:03:15,206 --> 00:03:19,245
And that is standing before me now.

17
00:03:19,326 --> 00:03:24,005
From now on, you won't go to the
frontiers marketplace! We will get married!

18
00:03:34,086 --> 00:03:39,525
Orhan! Orhan who does not know his limits!

19
00:03:39,646 --> 00:03:45,925
You won't behave, huh?
You won't behave, Mehmet.

20
00:03:52,766 --> 00:03:57,325
Gonca... Tell me...

21
00:03:59,326 --> 00:04:06,325
Aren't you going to say
something? Why are you silent?

22
00:04:13,206 --> 00:04:16,445
Do you.. -No.

23
00:04:16,565 --> 00:04:19,165
Alaeddin..

24
00:04:20,005 --> 00:04:22,605
I mean... -Brother!

25
00:04:22,846 --> 00:04:26,245
Brother!

26
00:04:26,566 --> 00:04:29,085
Sister... what happened?
-Brother...

27
00:04:29,126 --> 00:04:32,285
My Orhan brother abducted
Holofira from the marketplace.

28
00:04:32,286 --> 00:04:35,725
Mehmet Bey went after them
with his Alps. My brother is alone.

29
00:04:35,926 --> 00:04:39,605
Bad things will happen if
we cannot find them, brother.

30
00:04:41,166 --> 00:04:42,379
Come on! Come on!

31
00:04:42,391 --> 00:04:45,725
I will come with you!
My Allah, protect them...

32
00:04:59,086 --> 00:05:06,725
Beys... Do you think I used the
Bannerless to have you killed?

33
00:05:12,446 --> 00:05:16,325
Tell me..

34
00:05:17,286 --> 00:05:21,365
You are here, right in front of me.

35
00:05:25,806 --> 00:05:29,485
Tell me, what could have stopped me?

36
00:05:29,726 --> 00:05:34,245
You are planning your games
under a shadow, Osman.

37
00:05:34,846 --> 00:05:38,925
No Alp would stand next to you...

38
00:05:39,406 --> 00:05:42,685
...except for the Bannerless.

39
00:05:44,806 --> 00:05:48,565
If you are genuine with
your words, open the door!

40
00:05:48,646 --> 00:05:52,285
But you are making it difficult.

41
00:05:59,006 --> 00:06:02,845
Are you in the lands of enemies, Karasid Bey?

42
00:06:04,566 --> 00:06:08,485
You know how hospitable

43
00:06:15,766 --> 00:06:19,445
We will have dinner together!

44
00:06:23,206 --> 00:06:29,925
But only Allah knows what is
going to happen after that meal.

45
00:06:35,766 --> 00:06:39,685
It was not good that you left Vasilis behind.

46
00:06:41,926 --> 00:06:45,525
You can plan a game and
take him back, Crusader.

47
00:06:45,646 --> 00:06:51,605
In the end, he is alive. Did
you bring what I asked for?

48
00:06:52,446 --> 00:06:54,845
I did.

49
00:07:06,166 --> 00:07:09,045
The tax you asked for.

50
00:07:27,086 --> 00:07:29,165
I thought we were together in this.

51
00:07:29,406 --> 00:07:32,525
What belongs to Erlik Khan is only his.

52
00:07:32,686 --> 00:07:36,885
Glorious Mongols don't depend on anyone.

53
00:07:36,966 --> 00:07:40,405
But you depend on me.

54
00:07:42,566 --> 00:07:46,005
What about the weapons?

55
00:07:46,966 --> 00:07:53,485
Lords were informed. They will
prepare all of them and send the caravan.

56
00:07:53,646 --> 00:07:57,525
Byzantium's army will protect it.

57
00:07:58,686 --> 00:08:04,085
You are a smart man, Crusader.
You are working with the right person.

58
00:08:14,406 --> 00:08:17,645
Commander, Beys gathered in Osman's city.

59
00:08:17,966 --> 00:08:22,365
Osman and Yakup's sons
were seen in the forest.

60
00:08:24,886 --> 00:08:30,165
Let's go and kill them. -There is no need.

61
00:08:30,766 --> 00:08:35,485
I have the sword. You
be Ayhan. Do your politics.

62
00:08:35,686 --> 00:08:40,125
Confuse them and turn them into enemies.

63
00:08:42,806 --> 00:08:49,525
Then I should go and do my duty.

64
00:08:50,246 --> 00:08:54,765
Nokers! Come on! -Take the gold.

65
00:08:55,806 --> 00:08:59,085
Come on.

66
00:09:11,046 --> 00:09:14,725
Your Alps must have killed the Bannerless...

67
00:09:14,886 --> 00:09:18,565
...already, huh, Osman Bey?

68
00:09:37,566 --> 00:09:41,445
Walk! Move!

69
00:09:43,126 --> 00:09:46,725
You drew your swords
against the great Beys of Turks!

70
00:09:46,846 --> 00:09:50,565
Now... You will either surrender...

71
00:09:50,686 --> 00:09:56,365
...or I will destroy you all
with the order of Osman Bey!

72
00:09:56,486 --> 00:09:59,765
Dastards!

73
00:10:01,166 --> 00:10:04,645
Move! Go!

74
00:10:28,526 --> 00:10:34,925
The leader of the warriors
and the people is the Bey.

75
00:10:36,646 --> 00:10:41,605
How dare you set a trap against Beys, huh?

76
00:10:42,966 --> 00:10:48,165
And as if it was not enough, you
said Osman Bey ordered you to do so!

77
00:10:48,806 --> 00:10:53,205
And you tried slandering huh?

78
00:10:59,046 --> 00:11:04,885
Boran! Aykurt!

79
00:11:07,246 --> 00:11:13,085
My word is the swords of my men!

80
00:11:15,526 --> 00:11:20,685
You will learn the cost of doing this!

81
00:11:26,766 --> 00:11:30,645
Wait, my Osman Bey!

82
00:11:36,606 --> 00:11:40,685
This is the letter we received.

83
00:11:42,126 --> 00:11:45,605
It says you sent it.

84
00:11:46,246 --> 00:11:50,325
And we did our duty.

85
00:11:56,766 --> 00:12:02,485
Turkmen Beys who are deficient in
obedience will arrive in Yenisehir tomorrow.

86
00:12:02,686 --> 00:12:06,165
You will shoot them on the road.

87
00:12:21,046 --> 00:12:29,805
There is not even a seal on
it. Which duty are you off to?

88
00:12:35,966 --> 00:12:40,005
Whoever did this treachery..

89
00:12:41,406 --> 00:12:45,245
Will pay for this.

90
00:12:45,366 --> 00:12:49,685
Was there no traitor in
your palace, Osman Bey?

91
00:12:50,206 --> 00:12:54,165
It seems this is not the only one.

92
00:12:54,526 --> 00:12:59,965
The rest, those who
heard you calling the beys..

93
00:13:00,166 --> 00:13:05,845
Planned trickery to set us against each other.

94
00:13:11,326 --> 00:13:14,045
-Shamil.
-My Bey.

95
00:13:14,686 --> 00:13:22,045
-Take them to prison. I will have them answer.
-As you command, my bey.

96
00:13:25,726 --> 00:13:31,605
You will know what it means
to swing swords to Turks, move!

97
00:13:38,806 --> 00:13:41,925
Osman Bey.

98
00:13:44,886 --> 00:13:53,405
Why did you call the beys? Even
without their Sultan's knowledge?

99
00:13:53,686 --> 00:13:58,205
It is now apparent.

100
00:13:59,326 --> 00:14:04,725
I do not accept your sultanate.

101
00:14:10,406 --> 00:14:16,045
My mercy is not infinite, Osman!

102
00:14:17,646 --> 00:14:21,445
Mine as well, Yakup Bey.

103
00:14:23,006 --> 00:14:26,365
I don't have much patience as well.

104
00:14:29,446 --> 00:14:37,405
Both against enemies and against
those who help the traitors among us.

105
00:14:39,126 --> 00:14:41,616
-What will we do now, Osman Bey?

106
00:14:41,628 --> 00:14:44,205
The drums of
war will be played.

107
00:14:44,606 --> 00:14:50,045
-A field will be prepared.
-Osman Bey.

108
00:14:50,766 --> 00:14:54,205
Stop dreaming.

109
00:14:54,406 --> 00:15:00,925
What will we do against Mongols,
whom defeated many states?

110
00:15:01,366 --> 00:15:06,085
We are a hand, that can not even unite yet.

111
00:15:06,166 --> 00:15:08,205
Will we challenge Mongols?

112
00:15:08,406 --> 00:15:12,725
This is a independence fight
Yakup Bey, it won't be easy.

113
00:15:13,046 --> 00:15:18,045
Even if we are few, we will prevail.

114
00:15:21,046 --> 00:15:28,445
However, know this. It won't be you..

115
00:15:28,686 --> 00:15:31,965
Who will lead the army.

116
00:15:58,366 --> 00:16:05,125
-Peace be upon you.
-Peace be upon you too.

117
00:16:08,846 --> 00:16:13,125
You did wrong Orhan, wrong!

118
00:16:13,286 --> 00:16:18,485
-Now who will save you from my hands?
-Shut your mouth.

119
00:16:18,606 --> 00:16:23,885
-Get out of my way, Mehmed.
-Holofira.

120
00:16:24,046 --> 00:16:30,005
-Do you want to go with Orhan?
-Enough! I don't want to see both of you!

121
00:16:31,406 --> 00:16:36,805
-I said stay behind me.
-Holofira doesn't want to come with you, Orhan.

122
00:16:36,926 --> 00:16:40,645
Let her go.

123
00:16:41,566 --> 00:16:48,045
Holofira came here with me^
she can leave only with me.

124
00:16:50,406 --> 00:16:55,085
If you want to take her, you
have to go through me, Mehmed.

125
00:16:55,286 --> 00:17:01,005
Alright then. Come and
I will destroy you, come!

126
00:17:03,366 --> 00:17:07,525
Who will destroy who?

127
00:17:12,806 --> 00:17:19,444
If there are some who will
choose the path of peace..

128
00:17:20,406 --> 00:17:24,525
After my father Candar Bey
became martyr, I am not with them.

129
00:17:26,685 --> 00:17:34,805
When Osman Bey said council, guessed it's
a council of war, so I brought the army.

130
00:17:37,126 --> 00:17:42,085
I will be with Osman Bey.

131
00:17:50,846 --> 00:17:56,005
There is a Bey of Turks, long live.

132
00:17:58,166 --> 00:18:02,685
How many alps do you have, Suleyman Bey?

133
00:18:03,246 --> 00:18:07,445
Your father used to not do
anything without counting.

134
00:18:08,686 --> 00:18:12,325
-You get eager very easily.
-Death..

135
00:18:12,526 --> 00:18:16,765
Does not differ those who count
from those who does not, Yakup Bey.

136
00:18:16,846 --> 00:18:22,285
Seven thousand of my
alps is ready, Alhamdulillah.

137
00:18:24,926 --> 00:18:28,765
Alright, alright.

138
00:18:30,366 --> 00:18:34,725
If Osman Bey deploys ten thousand horsemen..

139
00:18:34,926 --> 00:18:39,605
You can walk to death together.

140
00:18:42,726 --> 00:18:50,765
The first duty of a Sultan
is to keep his people alive.

141
00:18:50,926 --> 00:18:55,365
I won't let you break my people.

142
00:18:55,926 --> 00:19:00,605
Pull yourselves together.

143
00:19:00,766 --> 00:19:06,405
Since Osman Bey wants to be obeyed,
wants an army under his command..

144
00:19:06,566 --> 00:19:13,125
It is not something that
can be decided hastily.

145
00:19:14,006 --> 00:19:19,445
There will be a council at
frontier marketplace tomorrow.

146
00:19:19,646 --> 00:19:23,765
Everyone will think about it.

147
00:19:23,926 --> 00:19:27,285
Then declare their decision.

148
00:19:28,086 --> 00:19:35,645
You are correct, Yakup Bey. However,
it will not be at frontier marketplace.

149
00:19:38,366 --> 00:19:43,565
It will be at a secret place that I will say.

150
00:19:46,646 --> 00:19:52,405
I will let you know the place.
So that neither the infidels..

151
00:19:52,566 --> 00:19:56,965
Nor someone from us will set a trap.

152
00:19:57,086 --> 00:20:02,405
There is no more trickery,
Osman Bey. Whatever happens..

153
00:20:02,566 --> 00:20:08,405
It will happen face to face. An
eye for an eye, a tooth for a tooth.

154
00:20:08,606 --> 00:20:14,605
As always Yakup Bey. As always.

155
00:20:27,726 --> 00:20:32,685
Alps! Stop!

156
00:20:36,126 --> 00:20:40,965
Brother, don't do it! Stay calm brother!

157
00:20:41,046 --> 00:20:43,965
-Alaeddin move away.
-Brother, what are you doing!

158
00:20:44,166 --> 00:20:47,765
Move sister, move! Orhan will
learn his lesson today, move!

159
00:20:47,886 --> 00:20:49,965
-No!
-Who will learn lesson..

160
00:20:50,166 --> 00:20:52,965
-Who will not, we'll see!
-Enough!

161
00:20:53,086 --> 00:20:57,405
I said enough! Enough brigandry.

162
00:21:06,126 --> 00:21:10,565
Children of Osman and Yakup.

163
00:21:14,526 --> 00:21:19,685
You bark a lot. However you won't bite anyone.

164
00:21:23,966 --> 00:21:26,245
We will take hatuns out of this place.

165
00:21:26,326 --> 00:21:30,605
I won't go. I won't run anywhere brother.
I will not leave you here.

166
00:21:30,686 --> 00:21:34,325
Sister, don't you see there is a
lot of them. This is not an escape.

167
00:21:34,526 --> 00:21:36,445
You will call far back up, quickly!

168
00:21:36,526 --> 00:21:41,005
-Sister, come on! Gonca come on!
-Quickly Gonca, quickly!

169
00:21:43,486 --> 00:21:44,765
Come here.

170
00:21:45,406 --> 00:21:50,365
Come here. The wolf's tooth wants your blood!

171
00:22:30,846 --> 00:22:33,205
Come on!

172
00:23:42,446 --> 00:23:45,845
Allah is the greatest!

173
00:24:07,966 --> 00:24:10,965
GERMIYANOGLU BORDER - FRONTIER MARKET

174
00:24:12,486 --> 00:24:14,885
Malhun Hatun.

175
00:24:18,886 --> 00:24:22,645
Orhan Bey doesn't want this, obviously.

176
00:24:24,966 --> 00:24:27,325
Before everyone talks about this...

177
00:24:27,366 --> 00:24:31,125
Listen to me, girl. I know you have pride.

178
00:24:31,366 --> 00:24:36,325
But this won't happen again. I will handle it.

179
00:24:36,606 --> 00:24:39,285
What will you handle Malhun Hatun?

180
00:24:39,526 --> 00:24:42,805
How could he abduct a girl from my market?

181
00:24:43,166 --> 00:24:46,725
Saadet Hatun, nobody abducted any girl.

182
00:24:46,886 --> 00:24:48,645
Don't make rumors.

183
00:24:48,806 --> 00:24:53,125
Making rumors would damage only my house.

184
00:24:53,246 --> 00:24:57,245
The girl your son took
on the back of the horse...

185
00:24:57,366 --> 00:24:59,685
...is the girl who my son is going to marry.

186
00:24:59,806 --> 00:25:05,765
Patience... You should pray that your
son won't make anything treacherous.

187
00:25:05,926 --> 00:25:08,325
If something happens to my son,

188
00:25:08,326 --> 00:25:12,645
Treachery is what you know best.

189
00:25:14,006 --> 00:25:18,365
What you have done is a cause of war.

190
00:25:18,646 --> 00:25:22,525
-Saadet Hatun.
-You are deceiving this girl.

191
00:25:25,286 --> 00:25:29,685
Your son is running after other girls.

192
00:25:32,206 --> 00:25:36,005
Hear your words, hatun!

193
00:25:50,326 --> 00:25:56,445
Erlik Khan has presented his
wrath. Demons will bite your soul!

194
00:26:05,406 --> 00:26:07,565
Come.

195
00:26:10,766 --> 00:26:15,365
When I take your head, this game will be over.

196
00:26:31,046 --> 00:26:33,965
We can't resist! We should retreat!

197
00:26:33,966 --> 00:26:36,965
Brother! Archers! Draw back!

198
00:26:37,126 --> 00:26:41,845
-Come on, Orhan!
-We're going back into the woods! Come on!

199
00:27:05,766 --> 00:27:08,165
Fathima.

200
00:27:09,406 --> 00:27:11,565
Mother.

201
00:27:11,686 --> 00:27:14,245
-Mother.
-What happened? Where are your brothers?

202
00:27:14,246 --> 00:27:16,245
-Mongolians attacked.
-What?

203
00:27:16,246 --> 00:27:19,245
Gonca. Holofira, are you alright?

204
00:27:19,686 --> 00:27:23,005
My brothers and Mehmed Bey
are repelling the Mongolians.

205
00:27:24,126 --> 00:27:28,925
-They are too many, mother.
-What are you saying?

206
00:27:29,286 --> 00:27:32,725
Alps, go help Orhan Bey! Come on!

207
00:27:33,406 --> 00:27:37,085
Alps, you too! Quickly!

208
00:27:37,806 --> 00:27:41,085
We're going to Yenisehir.
We should let them know.

209
00:27:41,646 --> 00:27:44,885
Let's go inside the tent.
We will be safe there.

210
00:27:45,166 --> 00:27:48,005
Thanks.
Let's go.

211
00:27:48,286 --> 00:27:51,245
Suleyman Bey settled in the
inn you mentioned, my Bey.

212
00:27:51,246 --> 00:27:52,765
-He's resting.
-Good.

213
00:27:52,886 --> 00:27:56,405
He says he supports you,
my Bey. But will we trust him?

214
00:27:56,646 --> 00:28:00,565
He helped us in hard
times. We will trust for now.

215
00:28:00,686 --> 00:28:04,925
Those who know you, both trust you
and want to share your dreams, my Bey.

216
00:28:05,006 --> 00:28:07,205
What else could we do?

217
00:28:07,486 --> 00:28:11,325
Tell me. Any news from the spies in Konya?

218
00:28:11,726 --> 00:28:14,725
We'll get new information
before the sunset, my Bey.

219
00:28:14,726 --> 00:28:17,685
We also placed watchmen
in the frontier market, my Bey.

220
00:28:17,686 --> 00:28:21,165
If Allah permits, we will learn
where the dog called Veysel is.

221
00:28:21,326 --> 00:28:26,085
Alright, alright. Tell
the army to stand on alert.

222
00:28:26,926 --> 00:28:30,885
Suleyman Bey has come all prepared.

223
00:28:32,286 --> 00:28:36,485
We will prepare the army too...

224
00:28:36,686 --> 00:28:40,565
...so we can encourage the
beys to prepare their armies too.

225
00:28:42,326 --> 00:28:46,085
Osman Bey! Osman Bey!

226
00:28:47,086 --> 00:28:50,365
If you are to recruit an army, I'm here!

227
00:28:50,406 --> 00:28:53,205
Nobody can go to battle without me!

228
00:28:53,766 --> 00:28:56,285
Look at him!

229
00:28:57,406 --> 00:29:00,525
Oh Ghazi... Ghazi...

230
00:29:00,646 --> 00:29:04,405
Just wait. Wait, Cerkutay.

231
00:29:09,046 --> 00:29:13,125
Ghazi, listen.

232
00:29:14,086 --> 00:29:16,725
It's difficult to be an alp.

233
00:29:17,046 --> 00:29:19,805
Are you well trained?

234
00:29:21,766 --> 00:29:23,965
Test me, Osman Bey.

235
00:29:31,286 --> 00:29:35,245
You say so? Okay.

236
00:29:37,246 --> 00:29:41,325
Alps, everybody go to their duties!

237
00:29:41,646 --> 00:29:44,205
Ghazi and I are going to train.

238
00:29:44,446 --> 00:29:47,605
-As you order, my Bey.
-Sure, my Bey.

239
00:29:47,886 --> 00:29:49,565
As my Bey orders.

240
00:29:49,566 --> 00:29:53,685
Come on, Cerkutay. Come on.

241
00:29:59,926 --> 00:30:02,645
Give it to me.

242
00:30:07,046 --> 00:30:10,165
Show mercy for your Bey.

243
00:30:10,766 --> 00:30:12,125
Come.

244
00:30:24,126 --> 00:30:27,765
If archers hadn't come, I
would have killed that dog!

245
00:30:28,286 --> 00:30:30,005
Orhan, enough!

246
00:30:30,046 --> 00:30:33,485
If you hadn't taken Holofira away,
we wouldn't have faced the enemy.

247
00:30:33,526 --> 00:30:34,925
-Mehmed.
-Brother!

248
00:30:35,046 --> 00:30:37,845
Brother! Mehmed Bey! Stop.
They're surrounding us.

249
00:30:37,926 --> 00:30:40,645
The dogs smelled the blood. We need to go!

250
00:30:46,846 --> 00:30:52,165
For the blood of my nokers
you will bleed much more!

251
00:30:53,806 --> 00:30:57,925
By that time, you will have no blood left!

252
00:30:58,326 --> 00:31:00,405
-Come on!
-Come on!

253
00:31:00,446 --> 00:31:02,685
-Let's go!
-Let's go!

254
00:31:05,206 --> 00:31:07,925
Commander Karacelasun.

255
00:31:10,726 --> 00:31:13,765
We've got news from Tabriz.

256
00:31:23,246 --> 00:31:24,685
Good.

257
00:31:28,166 --> 00:31:31,765
I'm sparing their lives for
the sake of the great news.

258
00:31:31,966 --> 00:31:35,445
I got the position that I've been
expecting from Emir Coban.

259
00:31:36,886 --> 00:31:40,245
I'm the governor of Konya now.

260
00:31:41,406 --> 00:31:46,005
Great Mergen, play your drum
which is the melody of Tengri.

261
00:31:46,006 --> 00:31:49,765
Let's entertain the dark souls.

262
00:33:30,486 --> 00:33:34,125
-Peace be upon you, Dervish.
-Peace be upon you, too.

263
00:33:34,366 --> 00:33:37,125
This is the second time we have come across.

264
00:33:40,406 --> 00:33:43,685
You're coming from a fight again, obviously.

265
00:33:43,966 --> 00:33:48,325
Join us. Let me check your wound.

266
00:33:49,806 --> 00:33:53,805
The wound isn't important. But I will be glad.

267
00:33:54,086 --> 00:33:57,965
But I'd like to learn your name this time.

268
00:34:01,566 --> 00:34:06,565
-Join us first. Let me check the wound.
-Thank you.

269
00:34:19,126 --> 00:34:21,284
Ya Shafi (The One Who Cures)

270
00:34:21,926 --> 00:34:24,645
Ya Shafi (The One Who Cures)

271
00:34:29,326 --> 00:34:32,804
Thank you Dervish Effendi.

272
00:34:33,406 --> 00:34:37,764
You have started fighting
against the infidels,

273
00:34:37,926 --> 00:34:42,565
but it seems the battle inside
of you is giving you a hard time.

274
00:34:45,126 --> 00:34:48,364
On one side, my love...

275
00:34:48,446 --> 00:34:50,965
..on the other side, my mother.

276
00:34:52,166 --> 00:34:55,445
Without her permission...

277
00:34:56,045 --> 00:34:59,765
..I don't know how can I
do this, Dervish Effendi.

278
00:35:00,646 --> 00:35:04,245
It's like Uways (Q.S), is that so?

279
00:35:04,366 --> 00:35:09,845
Our people call him Uways al-Qarani
(Q.S), he had the same trouble.

280
00:35:10,926 --> 00:35:13,365
Uways (Q.S)

281
00:35:13,926 --> 00:35:17,445
is someone who was in
love with Rasulullah (PBUH).

282
00:35:17,526 --> 00:35:20,165
Sallalahu Alayhi wa Sallam.

283
00:35:20,366 --> 00:35:25,765
He longs to see him just once.

284
00:35:26,326 --> 00:35:32,245
He wants to go to Madina,
but his mother is an old woman

285
00:35:32,326 --> 00:35:37,045
she's blind and has no one but Uways (Q.S).

286
00:35:37,126 --> 00:35:44,725
She gives him one condition.
She says go but return quickly.

287
00:35:44,966 --> 00:35:49,685
Do not visit anywhere but
Rasulullah's (PBUH) house.

288
00:35:50,566 --> 00:35:55,405
Uways promises her mother to return quickly.

289
00:35:55,606 --> 00:35:59,525
He sets out and gets to Madina.

290
00:35:59,846 --> 00:36:04,525
He goes directly to Rasulullah's (PBUH) house.

291
00:36:05,566 --> 00:36:09,845
But Rasulullah (PBUH) is not at home.

292
00:36:10,486 --> 00:36:17,525
Uways (Q.S) gets so sad but
he also promised his mother.

293
00:36:17,846 --> 00:36:22,485
He explains the matter to Hadhrat Aisha(R.A.).

294
00:36:22,686 --> 00:36:26,325
He sends regards to our
Prophet (PBUH) and sets out.

295
00:36:26,486 --> 00:36:32,245
He goes to Yemen. When he
explains the matter to his mother

296
00:36:32,326 --> 00:36:38,205
his mother prays for him and says "You
couldn't see our Prophet (PBUH) in this world,

297
00:36:38,286 --> 00:36:42,205
may you see him and be his
neighbor in the afterlife, if Allah permits."

298
00:36:45,566 --> 00:36:49,645
On the other hand, Rasulullah
(PBUH) comes back home,

299
00:36:49,726 --> 00:36:56,005
and asks Hadhrat Aisha(R.A.)
"Aisha, who came here?"

300
00:36:57,366 --> 00:37:00,765
Hadhrat Aisha (R.A.) explains the matter.

301
00:37:00,886 --> 00:37:04,205
Rasulullah (PBUH) says that

302
00:37:04,766 --> 00:37:10,245
"His test was to keep
his promise to his mother.

303
00:37:10,486 --> 00:37:15,285
He kept his promise and passed the test.

304
00:37:15,366 --> 00:37:23,285
He couldn't see me in this world but
he will be my neighbor in the afterlife."

305
00:37:24,326 --> 00:37:28,485
Uways (Q.S), for the sake
of his mother's approval

306
00:37:28,566 --> 00:37:32,445
he left it to the afterlife, but

307
00:37:32,566 --> 00:37:36,525
he was rewarded with a great reward.

308
00:37:38,086 --> 00:37:44,045
So, there are lessons
we need to learn from it.

309
00:37:44,126 --> 00:37:48,165
Even being rewarded with a prayer of Prophet

310
00:37:50,126 --> 00:37:52,805
requires the approval of your mother.

311
00:37:52,886 --> 00:37:56,325
Yes, of course.

312
00:37:56,566 --> 00:38:02,925
But there's always a way to
get your mother's approval.

313
00:38:04,326 --> 00:38:10,805
You did not tell us your name, but
you healed us with your words again.

314
00:38:14,006 --> 00:38:20,725
The realm of love, a sacred place
Ancient, eternal, love's embrace

315
00:38:21,006 --> 00:38:26,805
The sayer of love's tender word, is
the tongue of power, by all, heard.

316
00:38:27,046 --> 00:38:32,205
The One Who speaks is Him
The One Who hears is Him,

317
00:38:32,566 --> 00:38:38,125
The One Who sees is Him,
The One Who shows is Him

318
00:38:38,646 --> 00:38:44,565
He is the One Who speaks every
word The image is a station of the soul.

319
00:38:44,806 --> 00:38:49,845
Image in blood speaks graceful words,
Within the blood, the words turn into action

320
00:38:49,966 --> 00:38:55,205
The image found its voice to say
The voice paves wisdom's way.

321
00:38:55,606 --> 00:39:00,445
Images in the shadow's frame,
Voice alone can't rise to fame

322
00:39:00,566 --> 00:39:05,325
one can't act without the blame,
it is the essence of message.

323
00:39:05,406 --> 00:39:09,605
This is our lover's wine, this is our flavour,

324
00:39:09,846 --> 00:39:15,405
The rose of the sherbet
of love that we entwine.

325
00:39:15,526 --> 00:39:22,885
You tell Him about Him, it is Him, He
is the One Who says it, the word is His

326
00:39:23,086 --> 00:39:28,885
He is ours, we belong to Him, From now
on, it is the glorification of the tongue.

327
00:39:35,646 --> 00:39:39,645
Yunus' words sound severe,

328
00:39:39,726 --> 00:39:44,685
The unbelievers fail to hear,
One immersed in a life of wrong,

329
00:39:44,926 --> 00:39:49,005
misses the recognition of Allah

330
00:39:56,606 --> 00:40:01,245
You... Dervish effendi?

331
00:40:03,126 --> 00:40:09,645
Are you Yunus Emre, the owner of these words?

332
00:40:10,406 --> 00:40:16,605
Our Rabb is the One who
makes me say these words.

333
00:40:17,766 --> 00:40:24,085
This poor man is the Yunus of Tapduk Emre.

334
00:40:24,286 --> 00:40:27,885
He is the Dervish of Tapduk Emre.

335
00:40:28,606 --> 00:40:33,725
That's why they call him Yunus Emre.

336
00:40:37,046 --> 00:40:41,125
We were under the shadow
on the shore of a river

337
00:40:41,246 --> 00:40:45,765
-but we were not aware of it.
-Astaghfirullah.

338
00:40:51,286 --> 00:40:57,045
My Sheikh would say "the one who kisses
one's hand kisses his own hand as well."

339
00:41:07,446 --> 00:41:13,365
e will stay under your shadow,
do you allow us, Yunus Emre?

340
00:41:13,446 --> 00:41:16,125
Astaghfirullah.

341
00:41:25,926 --> 00:41:29,445
They're here, Shahzades are here, Orhan Bey

342
00:41:29,686 --> 00:41:31,445
Alaeddin Bey is here!

343
00:41:31,526 --> 00:41:33,685
Stop. Come here.

344
00:41:33,806 --> 00:41:35,285
Welcome, sons.

345
00:41:35,406 --> 00:41:37,085
-Thank you.
-My son.

346
00:41:37,206 --> 00:41:39,485
-Orhan Bey. -Welcome.

347
00:41:39,686 --> 00:41:41,965
Thank you, my Valide.

348
00:41:43,326 --> 00:41:46,485
Thank you, mother.

349
00:41:52,646 --> 00:41:54,965
Are you wounded?

350
00:41:55,206 --> 00:41:58,405
No, no I'm all right.

351
00:41:58,606 --> 00:42:01,485
All right then.

352
00:42:02,926 --> 00:42:07,605
Look at you. What's the matter with you?

353
00:42:07,686 --> 00:42:11,965
-Nothing, mother.
-Yes.

354
00:42:12,406 --> 00:42:15,765
-We'll talk about it.
-We will.

355
00:42:15,886 --> 00:42:21,565
Very well, your sons are
back. Come on, I'm hungry.

356
00:42:26,606 --> 00:42:29,165
-Are you hungry?
-Is that so?

357
00:42:29,286 --> 00:42:31,525
She's so hungry!

358
00:42:41,566 --> 00:42:46,205
Sons, stop it. Leave my daughter alone.

359
00:42:46,686 --> 00:42:53,045
What's going on here? Come
on girl, have a seat. Shahzades.

360
00:43:00,886 --> 00:43:07,645
I hear about what you
do. Don't do those things.

361
00:43:12,286 --> 00:43:16,125
If you keep doing it

362
00:43:16,366 --> 00:43:20,485
you will pay for it heavily.

363
00:43:20,686 --> 00:43:26,485
You shouldn't play with
him. Do not act without orders.

364
00:43:29,686 --> 00:43:34,005
Come on, let's have a seat.

365
00:43:34,166 --> 00:43:37,165
Here.

366
00:43:38,446 --> 00:43:41,845
Come on.

367
00:43:46,246 --> 00:43:48,885
That's enough, Bey Father.

368
00:43:48,966 --> 00:43:52,885
I'm so tired of my brothers.

369
00:43:52,966 --> 00:43:58,525
Have them marry with someone
so their women would tolerate them.

370
00:43:59,206 --> 00:44:02,085
You're babbling again.

371
00:44:02,126 --> 00:44:04,965
Let me get married too, Osman
Bey. I'll take Gonca Hatun!

372
00:44:05,046 --> 00:44:07,845
Hey! Tawba, tawba.

373
00:44:08,166 --> 00:44:11,485
-Who does he act like?
-How should I know?

374
00:44:12,606 --> 00:44:14,765
Sit down, Ghazi.

375
00:44:14,886 --> 00:44:16,605
-Sit down and eat.
-Why would I?

376
00:44:16,766 --> 00:44:19,525
Eat the good foods, come on.

377
00:44:21,686 --> 00:44:25,885
Ghazi Alp, do not disobey your parents

378
00:44:25,966 --> 00:44:30,405
just to get married.

379
00:44:31,206 --> 00:44:35,285
But Ghazi Alp is smart.

380
00:44:35,566 --> 00:44:40,405
He does everything to convince his mother.

381
00:44:40,566 --> 00:44:43,605
That's right, you want Gonca Hatun too, right?

382
00:44:43,846 --> 00:44:46,045
-I don't want her.
-What?

383
00:44:46,806 --> 00:44:50,685
Gonca is a daughter of a
Bey. Why would she marry you?

384
00:44:52,566 --> 00:44:55,565
Maybe she already found a son of a Bey.

385
00:44:56,526 --> 00:45:00,885
What? Did she? Did she find someone? Tell me!

386
00:45:01,006 --> 00:45:04,885
I'll tell you about it, have some patience.

387
00:45:14,606 --> 00:45:17,605
GERMIYANOGLU BORDER - FRONTIER MARKET

388
00:45:22,206 --> 00:45:26,445
We had to cooperate with Orhan
against the Mongol dastards, my Bey.

389
00:45:26,846 --> 00:45:29,765
But our hostility continues.

390
00:45:29,926 --> 00:45:33,805
Then do what needs to be done, Mehmed.

391
00:45:34,126 --> 00:45:38,205
He will do it, of course.
He will marry Holofira.

392
00:45:38,286 --> 00:45:41,445
This will ruin Orhan.

393
00:45:41,566 --> 00:45:45,565
Keep us out of it, Hatun. You deal with it.

394
00:45:46,086 --> 00:45:48,965
Mehmed has other things to do.

395
00:45:56,206 --> 00:46:02,565
Osman... Osman, Osman, Osman...

396
00:46:04,166 --> 00:46:08,245
Osman can do anything to be the leader.

397
00:46:08,966 --> 00:46:14,525
Today, all the Beys were almost
going to pledge allegiance to him.

398
00:46:14,806 --> 00:46:18,365
I postponed the council just in time.

399
00:46:19,286 --> 00:46:23,645
The council will be set again tomorrow.

400
00:46:23,806 --> 00:46:26,165
Kanyumaz. -My Sultan.

401
00:46:26,926 --> 00:46:30,325
Send presents to all Beys.

402
00:46:30,686 --> 00:46:35,845
Tell them that we appreciate their loyalty.

403
00:46:36,006 --> 00:46:39,205
Yes my Sultan.

404
00:46:40,446 --> 00:46:45,125
Mehmet. You go and bring that Veysel dog.

405
00:46:45,366 --> 00:46:48,325
Let's not go to that council with empty hands.

406
00:46:48,886 --> 00:46:52,285
We will take Veysel's head there.

407
00:46:52,526 --> 00:46:56,645
Can I come in, my Sultan? -Come in.

408
00:46:57,886 --> 00:47:00,365
My Sultan. Ayhan Agha is coming.

409
00:47:00,526 --> 00:47:04,565
But they are crowded,
they have horses and carts.

410
00:47:04,686 --> 00:47:09,205
What happened? Let him come.

411
00:47:15,726 --> 00:47:18,725
Alaeddin...

412
00:47:18,966 --> 00:47:23,685
Tell me. Is the fire in your heart...

413
00:47:24,166 --> 00:47:28,845
...still burning? Or did it turn into ashes?

414
00:47:31,206 --> 00:47:35,765
Look... Your sister is
trying hard to marry you off.

415
00:47:41,606 --> 00:47:44,285
There is still time, father.

416
00:47:44,446 --> 00:47:48,125
Ooo, my Shahzade.. If I were your age...

417
00:47:48,206 --> 00:47:51,725
..I would marry Gonca Hatun right away!

418
00:47:53,606 --> 00:47:57,845
Ghazi... Ghazi... What are
we going to do with him, Ulgen?

419
00:47:57,926 --> 00:48:03,085
We are in trouble. Open
your mouth, my son. Open it.

420
00:48:03,326 --> 00:48:08,085
Eat, my lion. Eat..

421
00:48:08,206 --> 00:48:11,793
What are we going
to do with him, Ulgen?

422
00:48:11,805 --> 00:48:13,005
Look...

423
00:48:14,646 --> 00:48:18,605
Make him eat, it will keep
him busy. He must not talk.

424
00:48:19,326 --> 00:48:24,125
What about you, my
Shahzade? Will you also wait?

425
00:48:31,686 --> 00:48:37,045
If my father and mother allow...

426
00:48:38,086 --> 00:48:41,725
...I do not want to wait, Ghazi.

427
00:48:42,646 --> 00:48:42,965
Q’sdeeeoe.

428
00:48:42,966 --> 00:48:48,085
My Osman Bey, my Malhun Hatun,
why don't you let Orhan Bey get married?

429
00:48:51,446 --> 00:48:56,885
Ghazi Alp... Mothers-in-law
deal with daughters-in-law.

430
00:48:56,966 --> 00:49:01,085
Bey fathers do not interfere.

431
00:49:05,606 --> 00:49:09,965
Can I come in, my Bey? -Come in.

432
00:49:11,926 --> 00:49:14,445
-Come.
-Thank you, my Bey.

433
00:49:14,846 --> 00:49:16,605
It's important.

434
00:49:21,366 --> 00:49:29,165
Kay iFamilyTV.com THE LEADING
TURKISH SERIES PLATFORM

435
00:49:32,406 --> 00:49:35,645
My sons.

436
00:49:36,366 --> 00:49:39,885
Alps. Come with me.

437
00:49:41,206 --> 00:49:44,205
Come on.

438
00:49:48,726 --> 00:49:51,645
I came here for Veysel.

439
00:49:52,886 --> 00:49:56,125
What are you saying, Ayhan Agha?

440
00:49:59,726 --> 00:50:04,565
If you allow me, I want to say a few words.

441
00:50:15,126 --> 00:50:18,485
If you allow me, my Sultan..

442
00:50:18,686 --> 00:50:24,405
...I want you to cut that dog
Veysel's head off with this sword.

443
00:50:24,646 --> 00:50:28,125
Did you come all that way
to say this, Ayhan Agha?

444
00:50:28,206 --> 00:50:31,805
With this sword, my Sultan...

445
00:50:32,646 --> 00:50:39,885
...Crusaders martyred my
friend who I called "my brother".

446
00:50:40,806 --> 00:50:44,005
I want revenge, my Sultan.

447
00:50:44,446 --> 00:50:49,645
I want to cut his head off, my Sultan.

448
00:50:57,446 --> 00:51:00,445
The world of Islam...

449
00:51:00,686 --> 00:51:07,085
...is the da'wah of all of us, my
Sultan. May Allah make you believe...

450
00:51:07,166 --> 00:51:13,565
...I suffered for so long because of
those dogs of Byzantium, my Sultan.

451
00:51:16,486 --> 00:51:20,325
And I heard something
really important, my Sultan.

452
00:51:21,246 --> 00:51:25,485
That dog named Veysel that traitor...

453
00:51:25,686 --> 00:51:30,445
...is important for the Crusaders.

454
00:51:32,966 --> 00:51:37,525
I know. I know. -What will crusaders do...

455
00:51:37,606 --> 00:51:41,045
...to save that dog?

456
00:51:41,246 --> 00:51:45,085
I wonder how many Lords would...

457
00:51:45,166 --> 00:51:51,605
...give up on their treasury for
that piece of devil... But, I know...

458
00:51:51,726 --> 00:51:56,205
...revenge is more important for you.

459
00:51:56,326 --> 00:52:00,285
For revenge, you will reject the Lords'...

460
00:52:00,446 --> 00:52:05,005
...treasury, for sure.

461
00:52:12,726 --> 00:52:17,405
Ayhan Agha... Revenge...

462
00:52:17,526 --> 00:52:21,325
...can also be taken without taking lives.

463
00:52:21,966 --> 00:52:28,685
For some, gold is more
important than their lives.

464
00:52:28,846 --> 00:52:33,885
Maybe... taking their gold...

465
00:52:34,006 --> 00:52:37,085
..will hurt the infidels more.

466
00:52:37,406 --> 00:52:42,125
But, my Sultan... We should
behead that dog! For a great Sultan...

467
00:52:42,206 --> 00:52:46,965
...why would gold be important?
-No.

468
00:52:47,366 --> 00:52:53,085
Since that son of the devil is worth a lot...

469
00:52:53,246 --> 00:52:57,205
...let's not waste it. Tomorrow...

470
00:52:57,326 --> 00:53:03,965
...we will give Veysel to Crusaders
and take their gold in return.

471
00:53:04,246 --> 00:53:09,085
Ayhan Agha... You are a trader.

472
00:53:09,406 --> 00:53:13,045
You will mediate.

473
00:53:13,126 --> 00:53:16,685
You will tell the Crusaders what we want.

474
00:53:17,006 --> 00:53:22,045
And during the exchange,
you will stand next to Mehmet.

475
00:53:27,286 --> 00:53:31,285
Go now. Safely.

476
00:53:31,606 --> 00:53:34,725
Yes, my Sultan.

477
00:53:52,926 --> 00:53:57,405
Father... Do we need gold?

478
00:53:57,566 --> 00:54:03,925
We will have caught two
birds with one stone, Mehmet.

479
00:54:05,126 --> 00:54:09,765
We do not need gold, but...

480
00:54:10,246 --> 00:54:15,805
...we need to get rid of all the infidels.

481
00:54:16,286 --> 00:54:21,205
We will destroy them all. And Osman...

482
00:54:21,286 --> 00:54:28,245
...and all Beys will see
the sultanate of Yakup Bey.

483
00:54:32,446 --> 00:54:34,965
Yakup Bey...

484
00:54:36,166 --> 00:54:38,485
...did not kill that dog named Vasilis.

485
00:54:38,566 --> 00:54:43,885
How and why, my Bey? His
carelessness turned into betrayal.

486
00:54:43,966 --> 00:54:47,725
My Bey, allow me to go...
-Don't you do that.

487
00:54:48,046 --> 00:54:51,565
My son... Don't.

488
00:54:51,966 --> 00:54:55,005
We will not be deceived like them, brother.

489
00:54:55,126 --> 00:55:00,005
Making a move before finding out
their intention will be wrong, my Bey.

490
00:55:00,726 --> 00:55:03,405
My sons.

491
00:55:03,566 --> 00:55:08,005
Tomorrow, you will go to the
frontiers marketplace with Alps.

492
00:55:08,086 --> 00:55:13,125
If you see Vasilis alive..

493
00:55:13,926 --> 00:55:17,516
...you will kill him and leave without
showing mercy to anyone...

494
00:55:17,516 --> 00:55:19,166
including Germiyan and Crusaders.

495
00:55:19,166 --> 00:55:21,445
Yes my Bey.

496
00:55:21,526 --> 00:55:26,165
Alright... But...

497
00:55:26,446 --> 00:55:31,205
There is more. I received
news from our spies in Konya.

498
00:55:31,286 --> 00:55:37,285
Tabriz assigned a new
Mongol Governor for Konya.

499
00:55:37,366 --> 00:55:42,285
They are getting ready under great
pressure. They even agreed with Byzantium.

500
00:55:42,846 --> 00:55:47,445
They prepared a big caravan carrying weapons.

501
00:55:47,686 --> 00:55:51,165
And they asked Byzantine to protecting it.

502
00:55:51,606 --> 00:55:54,725
If Byzantine's army will protect it...

503
00:55:54,846 --> 00:55:59,485
..it means a crowded and
armed army will be waiting for us.

504
00:56:00,686 --> 00:56:05,073
But we will make our
preparations accordingly my Bey.

505
00:56:05,085 --> 00:56:07,165
That's true. That's true.

506
00:56:07,286 --> 00:56:10,725
Gokmen!

507
00:56:12,166 --> 00:56:17,125
My Shahzade. -What happened, Mehmet?

508
00:56:19,286 --> 00:56:24,045
Were you afraid that I would kill
your man with my arm that you broke?

509
00:56:29,446 --> 00:56:33,685
I am not like Osman or
Orhan who you played with.

510
00:56:33,886 --> 00:56:37,205
I can take your breath away in a second.

511
00:56:43,566 --> 00:56:48,965
In the morning, we will
trade your worthless life.

512
00:56:52,566 --> 00:56:54,765
-Gokmen!
-My shahzade.

513
00:56:54,966 --> 00:56:59,325
No one will talk to him until morning.

514
00:56:59,406 --> 00:57:01,765
-Understood?
-As you command, my shahzade.

515
00:57:01,846 --> 00:57:05,165
We will depart in the morning.

516
00:57:07,566 --> 00:57:10,605
Mehmed.

517
00:57:13,606 --> 00:57:19,045
Didn't I tell you? You can not kill me.

518
00:57:19,166 --> 00:57:22,965
-I am immortal.
-For now..

519
00:57:23,086 --> 00:57:28,645
Shut your mouth. Don't
make me break your other arm.

520
00:57:36,606 --> 00:57:38,285
-Boran.
-My bey.

521
00:57:38,406 --> 00:57:43,245
Send your best scouts to
the caravan route in sunrise.

522
00:57:43,326 --> 00:57:46,685
-Let them do their work.
-As you command, my bey.

523
00:57:46,886 --> 00:57:51,285
As we say, it will be hard.
Of course it will be hard..

524
00:57:51,446 --> 00:57:54,885
So that the reward is big.

525
00:57:54,966 --> 00:57:58,205
There are a lot of weapons on this caravan.

526
00:57:58,286 --> 00:58:03,525
When we ambush the caravan,
take the weapons and hand them out..

527
00:58:03,606 --> 00:58:07,765
Tell me, how much our army will get bigger?

528
00:58:07,886 --> 00:58:10,845
At least two or three times more, my bey.

529
00:58:10,926 --> 00:58:13,525
When armed people start chanting war..

530
00:58:13,606 --> 00:58:16,165
No bey will run from fighting, my bey.

531
00:58:16,286 --> 00:58:20,445
This will allow us to fight in unity.

532
00:58:20,886 --> 00:58:25,085
My bey. Forgive me, however..

533
00:58:25,206 --> 00:58:28,885
Most of the alps will go with shahzades.

534
00:58:29,006 --> 00:58:31,925
-We remain few.
-So?

535
00:58:32,166 --> 00:58:36,725
You know the best, no doubt. However..

536
00:58:37,206 --> 00:58:40,285
Since we have these bannerless..

537
00:58:40,646 --> 00:58:46,325
We only saw harm from them, no help.

538
00:58:47,566 --> 00:58:55,205
Let us have them on the front,
let them be of use for once.

539
00:58:56,326 --> 00:58:59,525
You say so?

540
00:58:59,646 --> 00:59:04,605
-Beys, what do you say?
-It is correct, my bey.

541
00:59:09,926 --> 00:59:14,445
It is a good idea, my bey.

542
00:59:15,166 --> 00:59:18,565
Good, good. However..

543
00:59:18,846 --> 00:59:22,605
No one will know about
the ambush we will make.

544
00:59:23,166 --> 00:59:24,925
-Cerkutay.
-My bey.

545
00:59:25,006 --> 00:59:30,525
Tell beys the location of the council.
I will come there after the ambush.

546
00:59:30,646 --> 00:59:33,342
-As you command, my bey.

547
00:59:33,354 --> 00:59:35,845
Call the bannerless..

548
00:59:35,966 --> 00:59:39,245
To the place where we
will carry out the ambush.

549
00:59:39,766 --> 00:59:44,845
This will be their last chance. Who knows..

550
00:59:45,486 --> 00:59:49,525
Maybe for us as well.

551
00:59:49,966 --> 00:59:56,605
If we can not stop this caravan, then
we won't be able to stop these tyrants.

552
00:59:56,886 --> 01:00:02,965
If we can not have the beys
with us tomorrow, maybe..

553
01:00:03,766 --> 01:00:07,445
It will be hard to even protect ourselves.

554
01:00:07,566 --> 01:00:12,805
However, if we succeed, then..

555
01:00:13,126 --> 01:00:18,125
No one will be able to stand in
our way. With Allah's permission..

556
01:00:18,366 --> 01:00:21,205
We will call the whole world home.

557
01:00:21,326 --> 01:00:24,365
If Allah permits, my bey.

558
01:00:25,286 --> 01:00:28,245
If Allah permits.

559
01:00:31,326 --> 01:00:35,925
My mother. My dear mother.

560
01:00:36,006 --> 01:00:40,605
You are silent. That is the worst.

561
01:00:40,806 --> 01:00:45,405
I know how angry you are at
me. But do not remain silent.

562
01:00:45,966 --> 01:00:48,685
Look.

563
01:00:51,166 --> 01:00:55,765
If it weren't for your prayer,
my road would've been closed.

564
01:00:55,846 --> 01:01:00,605
I know that. And I don't want to go on road..

565
01:01:00,766 --> 01:01:05,245
Without your approval. However..

566
01:01:07,446 --> 01:01:10,605
I can not give up from Holofira, mother.

567
01:01:11,486 --> 01:01:17,565
I understood that very well today. Is
there no way to get approval from you?

568
01:01:19,366 --> 01:01:25,125
I understand you. However,
you did not understand me.

569
01:01:26,406 --> 01:01:28,765
So be it.

570
01:01:32,086 --> 01:01:35,125
I will take Holofira as a bride.

571
01:01:36,406 --> 01:01:39,205
-However, on one condition.
-What is it, mother?

572
01:01:39,566 --> 01:01:43,205
-Tell me, I will get to it quickly.
-Not you.

573
01:01:43,446 --> 01:01:46,125
-Holofira will do it.
-What will she do?

574
01:01:46,286 --> 01:01:49,365
She will become a muslim.

575
01:01:50,846 --> 01:01:55,365
Holofira. Will become a muslim.

576
01:02:00,766 --> 01:02:03,085
Sister, what are you doing here?

577
01:02:03,366 --> 01:02:07,045
Shush, this is the best part.

578
01:02:11,966 --> 01:02:16,125
Since you love her more than your life..

579
01:02:16,206 --> 01:02:20,365
Then so be it. Of course it will be hard.

580
01:02:20,446 --> 01:02:24,925
However, I will teach her
how to be a hatun of a bey.

581
01:02:25,166 --> 01:02:30,365
My mother. My dear mother,
I knew you would accept.

582
01:02:32,006 --> 01:02:34,405
My dear mother.

583
01:02:38,686 --> 01:02:43,005
The love of children comes before all.

584
01:02:44,286 --> 01:02:48,605
Sister, did you hear that too?

585
01:02:49,686 --> 01:02:53,885
-May it be blessed brother.
-My brother.

586
01:02:55,526 --> 01:02:59,165
-It is your turn now.
-I hope so, I hope so.

587
01:02:59,326 --> 01:03:03,725
I got rid of one of my brother,
now it is the other's turn.

588
01:03:03,846 --> 01:03:07,125
Look what she is saying.

589
01:03:07,206 --> 01:03:12,845
Maybe, the time you will get
rid of your other brother is nigh.

590
01:03:13,126 --> 01:03:18,485
-Mother, don't.
-Come here.

591
01:03:18,766 --> 01:03:21,365
You will tell me everything.

592
01:03:22,046 --> 01:03:25,765
-Bala mother, you've heard it, Osman
Bey is waiting for us, we shall leave.

593
01:03:25,846 --> 01:03:29,365
-Come on brother.
-He is waiting for us, mother.

594
01:03:30,486 --> 01:03:35,445
My valiant brother, you saved
me just in time again, thank you.

595
01:03:38,206 --> 01:03:44,325
Holofira, my dear daughter.
This issue is not a good sign.

596
01:03:44,486 --> 01:03:47,645
You have to make a choice now.

597
01:03:47,846 --> 01:03:50,765
lam very confused Saadet Hatun.

598
01:03:50,846 --> 01:03:55,725
I know. I know of course.

599
01:03:55,806 --> 01:04:02,005
I know that this will not work
with Orhan, can you see it as well?

600
01:04:02,406 --> 01:04:07,005
-Or are you still..
-No.

601
01:04:07,086 --> 01:04:09,285
For me, Orhan is no more.

602
01:04:11,726 --> 01:04:15,725
Malhun Hatun is right. We can not be together.

603
01:04:15,886 --> 01:04:20,565
-So you've spoken with Malhun.
-Yes.

604
01:04:22,286 --> 01:04:25,845
She wants me to go.

605
01:04:26,166 --> 01:04:31,325
I understand her. She is thinking about Orhan.

606
01:04:31,606 --> 01:04:34,685
I need to finish this trading business here.

607
01:04:35,126 --> 01:04:37,085
I will leave, Saadet Hatun.

608
01:04:37,166 --> 01:04:41,205
Will you leave, just
because Malhun told you so?

609
01:04:41,366 --> 01:04:45,205
-Don't you have your own order here?
-No.

610
01:04:45,286 --> 01:04:50,125
Not just because of her.

611
01:04:50,406 --> 01:04:53,445
But for Orhan.

612
01:04:53,766 --> 01:04:56,845
My dear daughter.

613
01:04:56,966 --> 01:05:00,965
Who are you sacrificing yourself for.

614
01:05:01,486 --> 01:05:07,045
Open your eyes widely. Orhan is naive.

615
01:05:07,366 --> 01:05:11,125
Both his mind and his heart is naive.

616
01:05:11,486 --> 01:05:16,485
What I am trying to say
is if Orhan's love was true..

617
01:05:16,726 --> 01:05:21,085
They would be arranging your wedding now.

618
01:05:21,166 --> 01:05:24,645
No one, not even Malhun can stand..

619
01:05:24,966 --> 01:05:31,365
In the way of true love. Don't go anywhere.

620
01:05:32,486 --> 01:05:37,205
Stay firm here, near me.

621
01:05:37,406 --> 01:05:41,245
My son has also fallen for you it seems.

622
01:05:41,326 --> 01:05:44,445
I want you to be my bride.

623
01:05:46,166 --> 01:05:49,045
I will think about it.

624
01:05:54,766 --> 01:05:58,125
Now, if you'll allow me.

625
01:06:04,486 --> 01:06:09,285
My Saadet Hatun, Guice has things
to say. She is waiting by the door.

626
01:06:09,366 --> 01:06:11,565
Let her in.

627
01:06:13,246 --> 01:06:17,245
Guice, tell me what happened?

628
01:06:17,526 --> 01:06:24,245
Alaeddin Bey has opened up to
Gonca Hatun. Told her he loves her.

629
01:06:24,326 --> 01:06:31,125
-Alright, and what did Gonca do?
-Gonca Hatun..

630
01:06:34,726 --> 01:06:38,765
You put me in such a spot, scholar..

631
01:06:39,006 --> 01:06:42,925
I don't know what to do.

632
01:06:43,126 --> 01:06:48,285
You on one side, my family on the other.

633
01:06:57,286 --> 01:07:00,285
My Gonca.

634
01:07:03,526 --> 01:07:07,024
-What are you thinking
about, my dear daughter.

635
01:07:07,036 --> 01:07:08,325
Nothing, mother.

636
01:07:14,966 --> 01:07:20,645
Stay close to Holofira. She
will wed your brother soon.

637
01:07:21,846 --> 01:07:26,085
Won't this marriage make things
worse between Kayi and us, mother?

638
01:07:26,206 --> 01:07:28,365
Why would it?

639
01:07:28,806 --> 01:07:32,125
Didn't you say they would
make Orhan marry Aysima?

640
01:07:32,446 --> 01:07:37,525
Yes, but Orhan Bey loves Holofira.

641
01:07:37,966 --> 01:07:40,805
If this marriage happens,

642
01:07:41,006 --> 01:07:45,085
...Orhan Bey and my brother
will be enemies forever.

643
01:07:47,446 --> 01:07:52,005
Then... What you want from me...

644
01:07:52,126 --> 01:07:56,965
I mean... Alaaddin Bey and
I will be enemies, mother.

645
01:08:01,446 --> 01:08:05,285
It's totally different.

646
01:08:06,286 --> 01:08:11,325
When Orhan loses Holofira,
he will turn against his house.

647
01:08:11,726 --> 01:08:15,645
Then things will be as we want.

648
01:08:16,046 --> 01:08:19,604
When you win Alaaddin's heart

649
01:08:19,765 --> 01:08:23,524
...nobody can stand against your father.

650
01:08:25,486 --> 01:08:28,524
Did Alaaddin bare his heart to you?

651
01:08:30,526 --> 01:08:33,685
You wouldn't hide anything from me, would you?

652
01:08:34,246 --> 01:08:39,325
No, mother. Alaaddin Bey doesn't trust me.

653
01:08:39,526 --> 01:08:44,245
-He listens to his mind.
-He will listen to you.

654
01:08:46,046 --> 01:08:48,765
Very soon.

655
01:08:49,845 --> 01:08:55,285
Gonca, if you say you can't
do this, I will take over this.

656
01:08:55,926 --> 01:08:57,685
What will you do, mother?

657
01:09:01,606 --> 01:09:06,005
You will see when I do.

658
01:09:20,805 --> 01:09:24,085
What will you do, mother?

659
01:09:25,765 --> 01:09:29,365
Well... I'm listening, son.

660
01:09:32,206 --> 01:09:36,604
-Mother. I am...
-Yes?

661
01:09:40,606 --> 01:09:43,965
I love Gonca Hatun.

662
01:09:50,006 --> 01:09:53,564
This is not new.

663
01:09:55,486 --> 01:10:00,125
My dear... You finally
confessed it to yourself, huh?

664
01:10:00,806 --> 01:10:04,245
Not only to myself, mother.

665
01:10:05,086 --> 01:10:07,005
I told Gonca too.

666
01:10:07,206 --> 01:10:11,085
Oh... Really?

667
01:10:11,806 --> 01:10:16,005
-What did she say?
-Nothing.

668
01:10:17,246 --> 01:10:19,525
How come?

669
01:10:20,206 --> 01:10:24,245
Doesn't she love you?

670
01:10:24,406 --> 01:10:29,205
When Fatma brought news from
Orhan, I couldn't get the response.

671
01:10:29,366 --> 01:10:31,485
Oh. I see..

672
01:10:32,646 --> 01:10:38,845
Fine. You will get the
response soon, I hope

673
01:10:39,086 --> 01:10:42,085
I hope so, I hope so.

674
01:10:44,366 --> 01:10:47,285
-Mother.
-Yes?

675
01:10:49,006 --> 01:10:52,005
I listened to my heart.

676
01:10:53,806 --> 01:10:57,685
-But my mind is still...
-I know.

677
01:10:58,206 --> 01:11:02,525
I know your fears. I'm
afraid of the same thing, son.

678
01:11:03,206 --> 01:11:07,085
Gonca is a good girl.

679
01:11:07,446 --> 01:11:10,765
But her mother and father are hostile to us.

680
01:11:11,046 --> 01:11:13,165
You say this won't work?

681
01:11:15,606 --> 01:11:19,605
No. I'm not saying anything yet.

682
01:11:21,046 --> 01:11:24,405
It's you who will find out, son.

683
01:11:27,846 --> 01:11:31,685
Neither let your heart blind your mind...

684
01:11:32,166 --> 01:11:35,885
...nor let your mind ignore your heart.

685
01:11:41,366 --> 01:11:44,405
How will I know, mother?

686
01:11:46,086 --> 01:11:49,485
Look into her eyes.

687
01:11:50,286 --> 01:11:54,405
What you see there is the truth.

688
01:12:02,966 --> 01:12:07,765
My lady, you are thinking about
what happened today, right?

689
01:12:12,366 --> 01:12:16,965
Orhan never understands me.

690
01:12:19,166 --> 01:12:22,405
He can't see he and I don't have a future.

691
01:12:22,486 --> 01:12:26,245
But today I saw him so
furious for the first time.

692
01:12:26,446 --> 01:12:29,325
His fury scares me.

693
01:12:30,886 --> 01:12:35,445
Mehmed Bey and he were like
they were going to kill each other.

694
01:12:35,726 --> 01:12:38,485
I'm afraid that's what will happen at last.

695
01:12:38,646 --> 01:12:43,805
A great war will begin
between Kayi and Germiyan.

696
01:12:44,246 --> 01:12:48,325
I feel trapped.

697
01:12:59,886 --> 01:13:03,725
There is only one person
who can get you out of it.

698
01:13:04,646 --> 01:13:08,925
Your aunt. Shall we send her a message?

699
01:13:11,046 --> 01:13:15,045
Never! Never, Alca.

700
01:13:15,366 --> 01:13:18,685
She shouldn't know anything.

701
01:13:19,326 --> 01:13:23,325
My aunt's arrival would be a disaster.

702
01:13:25,206 --> 01:13:27,765
Maybe, I should just go.

703
01:13:27,886 --> 01:13:31,005
I don't think Orhan Bey will let you go.

704
01:13:31,406 --> 01:13:34,445
He will give up only if you get married.

705
01:13:34,686 --> 01:13:38,005
What will your response to Mehmed Bey be?

706
01:14:01,526 --> 01:14:04,525
GERMIYANOGLU BORDER - FRONTIER MARKET

707
01:14:07,086 --> 01:14:11,205
Alca, this color is beautiful.

708
01:14:11,326 --> 01:14:15,605
-Put this on the front.
-Not as beautiful as you.

709
01:14:22,006 --> 01:14:27,845
No colors are as beautiful as you, Holofira.

710
01:14:31,006 --> 01:14:34,765
Can you get out, Orhan?
I don't want to see you.

711
01:14:35,086 --> 01:14:40,245
I told you that I would handle everything.

712
01:14:42,046 --> 01:14:48,685
Holofira... My mother and
father... They all accepted it.

713
01:14:51,126 --> 01:14:54,445
We can get married now.

714
01:14:59,886 --> 01:15:03,205
-How?
-Look.

715
01:15:05,046 --> 01:15:10,165
I have a duty now. But I
wanted to let you know this first.

716
01:15:11,286 --> 01:15:16,405
We will be together. We'll
be together soon, Holofira.

717
01:15:16,566 --> 01:15:20,645
With one condition, though. My mother...

718
01:15:23,246 --> 01:15:26,605
...wants you to be a Muslim.

719
01:15:30,206 --> 01:15:32,885
Orhan...

720
01:15:34,606 --> 01:15:38,325
How could you want me to do such a thing?

721
01:15:39,446 --> 01:15:43,445
How could you expect me to change my religion?

722
01:15:47,486 --> 01:15:52,005
Holofira, this is the only way.

723
01:15:59,046 --> 01:16:01,525
Orhan.

724
01:16:03,566 --> 01:16:07,925
-Don't expect me to do this.
-For us.

725
01:16:08,046 --> 01:16:11,165
For us to be together.

726
01:16:22,966 --> 01:16:27,805
Where are you, Gonca?
Where are you?

727
01:16:30,206 --> 01:16:32,605
-Alaaddin.
-Gonca.

728
01:16:32,726 --> 01:16:37,965
Thanks to Allah. I was
afraid I might not see you.

729
01:16:38,086 --> 01:16:41,285
Afraid?

730
01:16:44,486 --> 01:16:48,085
What are you doing here?

731
01:16:48,566 --> 01:16:51,445
I'm going to a mission.

732
01:16:52,326 --> 01:16:55,285
But before I leave

733
01:16:55,726 --> 01:16:58,485
..I want to hear your response.

734
01:17:01,286 --> 01:17:04,005
-Here? Now?
-Yes.

735
01:17:09,206 --> 01:17:11,725
Gonca.

736
01:17:14,846 --> 01:17:18,925
Alaaddin, let's go.

737
01:17:24,686 --> 01:17:28,605
You will wait longer for
the response, Scholar.

738
01:17:30,446 --> 01:17:33,205
You are playing coy, huh?

739
01:17:33,846 --> 01:17:37,125
Fine. So be it.

740
01:17:37,646 --> 01:17:40,005
Coy hatun.

741
01:17:42,686 --> 01:17:47,605
-Take care of yourself.
-You too.

742
01:17:54,206 --> 01:17:58,565
May Allah keep you safe.

743
01:18:08,126 --> 01:18:13,725
Today is the day to show
the power of Germiyan...

744
01:18:14,006 --> 01:18:18,485
...to Osman and all the other beys.

745
01:18:20,566 --> 01:18:23,525
Who supports the dog called Vasilis?

746
01:18:23,646 --> 01:18:26,925
What spies did they place among us?

747
01:18:27,046 --> 01:18:30,005
You will reveal all of these!

748
01:18:30,606 --> 01:18:35,325
And then kill them all.

749
01:18:37,286 --> 01:18:41,485
Mehmed, your victory...

750
01:18:41,726 --> 01:18:46,965
...will my biggest leverage
against the beys in the council.

751
01:18:49,446 --> 01:18:52,805
Today, everybody will see...

752
01:18:53,206 --> 01:18:56,645
...Osman Bey is just talking...

753
01:18:57,086 --> 01:19:01,405
...and Yakup Bey is being a Sultan.

754
01:19:01,966 --> 01:19:05,925
Alright, father. Both Vasilis...

755
01:19:06,006 --> 01:19:09,525
...and those coming to
take him will face our wrath.

756
01:19:09,766 --> 01:19:12,325
All the preparations are set.

757
01:19:12,486 --> 01:19:13,577
-Where is Ayhan Agha?

758
01:19:13,589 --> 01:19:16,245
He let Crusaders know
about the place of exchange.

759
01:19:16,366 --> 01:19:20,965
I told him to join us on the
way. He will be waiting for us.

760
01:19:21,326 --> 01:19:26,365
Alright then. Stay safe.

761
01:19:26,766 --> 01:19:30,445
May Allah bless your fight, son!

762
01:19:32,886 --> 01:19:38,205
May you have a safe journey
and a strong sword, son.

763
01:19:41,806 --> 01:19:46,365
Thank you mother, keep praying for me.

764
01:19:55,926 --> 01:20:00,565
We will be victorious and they will be ruined.

765
01:20:02,766 --> 01:20:05,205
There's no other way.

766
01:20:18,366 --> 01:20:22,565
Right on time, Crusader. Tell me about it.

767
01:20:22,726 --> 01:20:27,165
I tricked Yakup so bad
that he didn't kill Vasilis

768
01:20:27,246 --> 01:20:32,285
-to sell him to Crusaders.
-Is that why you made me wait?

769
01:20:32,486 --> 01:20:35,205
Yakup tricked you.

770
01:20:35,366 --> 01:20:39,165
He wouldn't change his mind
about killing Vasilis to take gold.

771
01:20:39,286 --> 01:20:42,805
Of course, Karacelasun.

772
01:20:43,806 --> 01:20:47,751
Yakup will want to use
Vasilis to find the power

773
01:20:47,763 --> 01:20:51,245
behind him and destroy
that power, old wolf.

774
01:21:01,006 --> 01:21:04,845
So they are not going for the
exchange, they are going for war.

775
01:21:05,006 --> 01:21:07,485
They are going for war.

776
01:21:07,606 --> 01:21:10,965
While they expect to see
a small Crusader group

777
01:21:11,126 --> 01:21:16,605
they will find Commander
Karacelasun, his nokers, his soldiers

778
01:21:17,126 --> 01:21:22,205
and my men. They will find a huge army.

779
01:21:22,966 --> 01:21:25,525
It will be their last battle.

780
01:21:25,646 --> 01:21:30,525
Good plan, Crusader.
But you attract suspicion.

781
01:21:32,486 --> 01:21:35,725
Astagfirullah.

782
01:21:39,846 --> 01:21:44,845
You'd make even the devils jealous.

783
01:21:49,446 --> 01:21:55,485
If your plan works one day,
we will form even more alliances.

784
01:22:05,726 --> 01:22:08,285
It will work, Mongol.

785
01:22:08,846 --> 01:22:13,485
I've never felt Jesus Christ

786
01:22:13,566 --> 01:22:16,925
so close to me.

787
01:22:18,406 --> 01:22:21,445
We're starting.

788
01:22:52,326 --> 01:22:55,125
Raise your head.

789
01:22:56,846 --> 01:23:00,045
Raise your head!

790
01:23:00,566 --> 01:23:05,125
Don't you hear Osman Bey? Raise your heads!

791
01:23:07,926 --> 01:23:14,125
How could you be so terrible enough
to think that I would attack the Beys?

792
01:23:14,206 --> 01:23:16,605
Osman Bey, we...

793
01:23:16,686 --> 01:23:20,365
We know that you want to lead.

794
01:23:21,846 --> 01:23:26,885
You want to kill the Beys
and be the only power.

795
01:23:27,166 --> 01:23:33,245
A state cannot be established by
killing the people of your own blood.

796
01:23:33,406 --> 01:23:36,165
It would only destroy you.

797
01:23:38,686 --> 01:23:43,765
How could you be so vile
enough to believe this order?

798
01:23:47,926 --> 01:23:54,165
We were exiled, Osman Bey. We have
always been attacked by our own blood.

799
01:23:54,286 --> 01:23:58,605
Bannerless ones would only
know the bannerless ones.

800
01:23:58,846 --> 01:24:03,045
But thanks to you, we are learning it again.

801
01:24:04,566 --> 01:24:10,405
You will learn it. You will learn it for sure.

802
01:24:10,526 --> 01:24:14,045
This is your last chance to live.

803
01:24:16,806 --> 01:24:21,645
I'll attack and you
will go first.

804
01:24:21,766 --> 01:24:28,245
Yes, Osman Bey. We didn't live like a
soldier but we want to die like a soldier.

805
01:24:33,526 --> 01:24:37,205
Allah knows that.

806
01:24:37,486 --> 01:24:41,885
We have found the caravan, my
Bey. They are going towards Altuntas.

807
01:24:42,206 --> 01:24:44,885
But there's worse.

808
01:24:45,846 --> 01:24:50,885
Mongol dastards are gathering there
my Bey, there are too many of them.

809
01:24:51,086 --> 01:24:55,525
It seems they will make the exchange there.

810
01:24:56,326 --> 01:24:58,965
My Bey, excuse me

811
01:24:59,246 --> 01:25:01,645
but we may not get another chance to hit them.

812
01:25:01,766 --> 01:25:07,645
We will hit them, Bayindir. Those
swords they have will be their death.

813
01:25:07,726 --> 01:25:13,085
Alps, come on. Take them too.

814
01:25:37,966 --> 01:25:40,925
Swords.

815
01:25:56,006 --> 01:25:59,565
These swords are made of the essence of iron.

816
01:25:59,686 --> 01:26:05,605
They have only one purpose and it
is to make Turks live the doomsday.

817
01:26:12,246 --> 01:26:15,725
Gold.

818
01:26:31,726 --> 01:26:35,565
Bring food, let's split our food.

819
01:26:35,646 --> 01:26:39,885
Let our friendship be permanent.

820
01:26:40,006 --> 01:26:44,565
We will kick the Turks
out of this land together.

821
01:27:19,766 --> 01:27:24,605
I miss her a lot.

822
01:27:25,846 --> 01:27:28,605
Who do you miss, Ghazi Alp?

823
01:27:28,766 --> 01:27:32,205
-Who do you think? Gonca Hatun of course.
-Ghazi!

824
01:27:32,286 --> 01:27:36,005
That's enough, you keep saying Gonca.
I don't want to hear her name again.

825
01:27:36,126 --> 01:27:39,325
Already jealous and
acting like a mother-in-law?

826
01:27:39,326 --> 01:27:44,965
Look at him. You'll see
how I act when I slap you.

827
01:27:48,766 --> 01:27:52,605
Let everyone know that Gonca Hatun is mine!

828
01:27:52,686 --> 01:27:57,405
Shut up!

829
01:27:58,446 --> 01:28:02,027
Ghazi Alp will be upset.
Today Alaeddin brother

830
01:28:02,039 --> 01:28:05,045
told that he is in love
with Gonca Hatun.

831
01:28:05,206 --> 01:28:09,245
-Really?
-Yes, keep it as a secret.

832
01:28:09,326 --> 01:28:13,925
You didn't hear it from me, all right?
Otherwise my Alaeddin brother would ruin me.

833
01:28:13,926 --> 01:28:15,805
Sure, I didn't hear it.

834
01:28:17,126 --> 01:28:22,085
I wish I hadn't heard that.
What am I going to do now?

835
01:28:22,726 --> 01:28:28,285
It would be worse if I keep quiet,
but who am I going to talk to?

836
01:28:30,206 --> 01:28:33,245
There's no other way.

837
01:28:34,086 --> 01:28:39,485
If I don't say it, they will
ruin my Alaeddin Bey.

838
01:28:54,566 --> 01:28:57,125
Beys!

839
01:28:57,446 --> 01:29:02,645
Are you bargaining without
the Bannerless ones?

840
01:29:03,766 --> 01:29:09,005
Where is our due?

841
01:29:09,406 --> 01:29:12,885
One of them is Crusader
and the other one is Mongol.

842
01:29:13,486 --> 01:29:16,285
What do they know about due?

843
01:29:19,326 --> 01:29:24,725
We have no choice but to kill them.

844
01:29:25,486 --> 01:29:30,285
For the intruder we offer death.

845
01:29:34,126 --> 01:29:35,485
Nokers!

846
01:29:39,046 --> 01:29:40,765
Attack!

847
01:31:08,566 --> 01:31:12,645
So you came to see the doomsday
before it broke loose, Osman.

848
01:31:12,646 --> 01:31:15,740
You are the one who
must be afraid of Qiyamah.

849
01:31:15,752 --> 01:31:18,925
Qiyamah is the ultimate
union for us. Come now.

850
01:31:23,406 --> 01:31:29,045
There are always valiants who will stop the
infidels on the lands they think they rule.

851
01:31:29,045 --> 01:31:30,475
Come now!

852
01:31:30,686 --> 01:31:37,685
This land is a homeland to friends,
graveyard to enemies!

853
01:31:54,206 --> 01:32:00,205
Come... Let me take my revenge on you.

854
01:32:23,366 --> 01:32:29,165
Your poor lands will be
watered with blood, Osman.

855
01:32:44,366 --> 01:32:50,645
These lands were watered with Turks' blood.
This is how it turned into a homeland.

856
01:32:51,366 --> 01:32:55,725
But you cannot even reach this land.

857
01:32:59,926 --> 01:33:07,085
Stand up. Stand up. You can even...

858
01:33:14,526 --> 01:33:20,685
-No...
-For Karacelasun's drop of blood...

859
01:33:20,886 --> 01:33:24,885
...Ilkhanid will punish you, Osman.

860
01:33:25,246 --> 01:33:30,085
Is that so? Come. Don't run. Come.

861
01:33:30,326 --> 01:33:34,805
Come. Look at me.

862
01:33:35,806 --> 01:33:42,685
Karacelasun became the
Ilkhanid's Konya Governor.

863
01:33:45,166 --> 01:33:50,485
He can be a governor or a Sultan!
An oppressor is an oppressor!

864
01:33:50,646 --> 01:33:55,725
And we never show mercy on the cruel!

865
01:34:00,326 --> 01:34:04,725
Make him stand up.

866
01:34:37,286 --> 01:34:40,685
My Bey... We have the weapons.

867
01:34:40,846 --> 01:34:42,525
-Alright.
-My Bey.

868
01:34:42,606 --> 01:34:49,245
Byzantium and Mongols will
stop for a while after this raid.

869
01:34:49,326 --> 01:34:53,485
No... Bayindir. It won't take long.

870
01:34:55,006 --> 01:35:03,325
Karacelasun became Ilkhanid's Konya Governor.
They won't stop. They will attack.

871
01:35:03,406 --> 01:35:07,125
It will be harder than before.
-What is your order, my Bey?

872
01:35:07,246 --> 01:35:10,325
We will be quick. Make your preparations.

873
01:35:10,726 --> 01:35:13,623
-Take all the weapons
and share with other tribes.

874
01:35:13,635 --> 01:35:14,605
Yes my Bey.

875
01:35:14,886 --> 01:35:18,226
Now the decision that will be
announced by the council is...

876
01:35:18,226 --> 01:35:20,966
is even more important.
If they stand next to us...

877
01:35:20,966 --> 01:35:24,405
...we will have a chance to win.

878
01:35:24,646 --> 01:35:29,085
But if they fall into carelessness...

879
01:35:29,246 --> 01:35:33,365
...then, may Allah help us.

880
01:35:33,526 --> 01:35:37,325
Aameen my Bey. -Come on.

881
01:35:44,966 --> 01:35:51,325
Gonca... Something is different about you.

882
01:35:52,886 --> 01:35:57,445
Nothing's different.
-There is something.

883
01:35:57,686 --> 01:36:02,445
You said we would be companions.

884
01:36:03,566 --> 01:36:09,605
I shouldn't talk about it while struggling
with so many problems, Holofira.

885
01:36:09,806 --> 01:36:17,565
Please, tell me. Besides, I want to
think about something else if I can.

886
01:36:19,006 --> 01:36:25,005
Is it about Alaeddin Bey? I can keep a secret.

887
01:36:33,446 --> 01:36:36,490
Alaeddin declared his love.

888
01:36:36,502 --> 01:36:39,885
I am so happy for you, Gonca.

889
01:36:43,006 --> 01:36:47,005
But I couldn't give him an answer.

890
01:36:49,286 --> 01:36:54,405
I am so confused, Holofira.
-Right.

891
01:36:55,046 --> 01:36:59,765
Your families...

892
01:37:00,806 --> 01:37:03,645
Right.

893
01:37:04,486 --> 01:37:10,685
It is impossible. You were
going to say that, right?

894
01:37:13,446 --> 01:37:19,685
Tell me... Is there any chance of
achieving the impossible, Holofira?

895
01:37:19,806 --> 01:37:26,285
Believe me, I don't know, Gonca.
That's what I ask myself every day.

896
01:37:28,366 --> 01:37:32,965
What does your heart say?

897
01:37:34,886 --> 01:37:38,405
My heart...

898
01:37:39,566 --> 01:37:44,805
...says, "If Alaeddin defeated his mind...

899
01:37:45,486 --> 01:37:49,845
...you can also do it."

900
01:37:59,766 --> 01:38:04,125
I love Alaeddin.

901
01:38:05,526 --> 01:38:10,045
I love him so much.

902
01:38:17,006 --> 01:38:23,245
Then go and talk to him,
Gonca. Fight for your love.

903
01:38:23,726 --> 01:38:26,965
Do you think so?

904
01:38:28,926 --> 01:38:37,285
You? What about you?
Orhan Bey loves you so much.

905
01:38:38,806 --> 01:38:44,005
He asked me to become a Muslim.

906
01:38:44,886 --> 01:38:51,205
If I become a Muslim, his
family will let us get married.

907
01:38:51,606 --> 01:38:55,965
What do you think about it?

908
01:38:58,246 --> 01:39:04,445
I don't know, Gonca.
I don't know.

909
01:39:06,006 --> 01:39:10,285
Gonca Hatun! Gonca Hatun!

910
01:39:10,406 --> 01:39:13,165
Gonca Hatun! -He arrived.

911
01:39:13,246 --> 01:39:19,645
Gonca Hatun! I missed you so much Gonca Hatun!
-I missed you too, Ghazi Alp.

912
01:39:19,846 --> 01:39:27,325
Gonca Hatun! -There is someone waiting
for you behind the marketplace, in the woods.

913
01:40:00,646 --> 01:40:05,085
-May it be easy, Aysima Hatun.
-Thank you.

914
01:40:05,406 --> 01:40:09,245
What you do is really hard.

915
01:40:12,646 --> 01:40:16,085
In the end, they won't let you marry Orhan.

916
01:40:16,286 --> 01:40:17,859
What are you saying?

917
01:40:17,871 --> 01:40:20,285
Everyone is talking about you.

918
01:40:20,366 --> 01:40:24,045
They say "Aysima is such an honourless girl."

919
01:40:24,326 --> 01:40:29,125
They say "She couldn't
put this girl in her place."

920
01:40:30,046 --> 01:40:33,925
I know what to do to her..

921
01:40:35,046 --> 01:40:38,045
You see that necklace?

922
01:40:40,486 --> 01:40:46,685
It is Orhan Bey's gift. You
are just having a dream.

923
01:40:47,206 --> 01:40:50,725
Orhan won't look at you.

924
01:40:50,806 --> 01:40:56,485
So, Aysima Hatun, you cannot reach the power..

925
01:40:56,806 --> 01:40:59,485
...you want so much.

926
01:41:17,806 --> 01:41:19,325
I can.

927
01:41:21,126 --> 01:41:26,125
I will be a Bey's Hatun
no matter what happens.

928
01:41:28,366 --> 01:41:33,285
All of you will see.

929
01:41:36,166 --> 01:41:40,765
Have you no shame, hatun?

930
01:41:44,766 --> 01:41:47,685
-What are you saying?
-You..

931
01:41:47,806 --> 01:41:52,045
Why are you still wandering around my fiance?

932
01:41:54,486 --> 01:41:58,125
Know your place, or
I will teach you.

933
01:41:58,326 --> 01:42:02,565
Who are you threatening on who's
land? You will go away from here.

934
01:42:02,686 --> 01:42:08,685
-You will leave Orhan alone.
-You can not tell me what to do.

935
01:42:29,246 --> 01:42:36,405
Holofira, Aysima. What are you doing?

936
01:42:41,166 --> 01:42:48,325
I did what is needed Malhun Hatun.
No one, I mean no one can touch me.

937
01:42:49,206 --> 01:42:53,485
Aysima, what is going on here?

938
01:42:54,566 --> 01:42:59,685
Holofira. You must apologise to Aysima.

939
01:42:59,766 --> 01:43:05,605
Holofira is not the one that
should apologise, it is Aysima.

940
01:43:50,606 --> 01:43:56,765
Ayhan Aga. If these crusader dogs
do not keep their word, it is on you.

941
01:43:56,966 --> 01:44:03,485
No way, my shahzade. They
were alarmed after hearing Vasilis.

942
01:44:03,606 --> 01:44:09,685
They should be here soon.

943
01:44:39,166 --> 01:44:43,765
You, the dog from prison in Kestel!

944
01:44:43,966 --> 01:44:48,165
Hadhrat shahzade, I brought your gold.

945
01:44:52,206 --> 01:44:55,245
Bring Vasilis.

946
01:44:57,926 --> 01:45:01,085
You waste of the devil.

947
01:45:02,246 --> 01:45:07,565
Heartless Mehmed. You are
giving him for gold, is that so?

948
01:45:07,886 --> 01:45:12,365
-I wouldn't expect that, even from you.
-What shall we do, my shahzade?

949
01:45:12,446 --> 01:45:16,205
-Should we get on them?
-No.

950
01:45:16,566 --> 01:45:21,125
Not now. We will wait.

951
01:46:06,686 --> 01:46:16,685
This gold is enough to claim many cities and
castles even, however I do not want it.

952
01:46:17,086 --> 01:46:25,365
I want something more valuable. The head
of the tyrant is more important than gold.

953
01:46:25,966 --> 01:46:31,485
I want your life! Alps!

954
01:46:41,686 --> 01:46:45,885
Not only Vasilis, but they
will also destroy his superior.

955
01:46:45,966 --> 01:46:49,685
Yakup Bey is playing big, brother.

956
01:46:49,766 --> 01:46:53,165
Correct.

957
01:46:57,726 --> 01:47:01,365
Erlik Khan, send your wrath!

958
01:47:01,366 --> 01:47:01,765
Gazabini gonder!

959
01:47:01,766 --> 01:47:07,325
Feed the flames of vengeance!

960
01:47:26,166 --> 01:47:31,685
Shahzade of Yakup. Today, death is your guest.

961
01:47:31,926 --> 01:47:36,765
My shahzade, I had no idea. I don't
know where these barbarians came from.

962
01:47:37,006 --> 01:47:43,125
You're under this as well, you mongol dog.

963
01:47:57,926 --> 01:48:03,405
And, where are you Alaeddin?

964
01:48:05,286 --> 01:48:10,485
Are you playing trickery again?

965
01:48:11,126 --> 01:48:16,485
-Gonca Hatun.
-Ulgen?

966
01:48:19,606 --> 01:48:23,405
What are you doing here?

967
01:48:23,566 --> 01:48:31,245
I called you here, Gonca Hatun.
You are waiting for Alaeddin Bey but..

968
01:48:33,846 --> 01:48:38,445
I know the tricks you are doing to him.

969
01:48:39,486 --> 01:48:44,045
-What are you saying, Ulgen?
-I thought you were different.

970
01:48:44,126 --> 01:48:48,005
However, you are just like your mother.

971
01:48:49,006 --> 01:48:51,605
No, you got it wrong.

972
01:48:51,686 --> 01:48:54,245
I've heard it all, Gonca Hatun.

973
01:48:54,486 --> 01:48:58,685
-What happened at the palace?
-Osman Bey.

974
01:48:59,686 --> 01:49:06,685
Will go to someone called
"Karacelasun". Their numbers are few.

975
01:49:07,126 --> 01:49:09,325
Alaeddin was supposed plan a route.

976
01:49:09,406 --> 01:49:13,365
You got close to Alaeddin Bey
just because your mother told you to.

977
01:49:13,366 --> 01:49:17,405
You told her about Osman
Bey going to Karacelasun.

978
01:49:18,966 --> 01:49:22,605
How can you do this to him?

979
01:49:23,806 --> 01:49:27,805
Did you tell this to Alaeddin?

980
01:49:28,446 --> 01:49:32,285
My shahzade can not handle this.

981
01:49:33,166 --> 01:49:38,565
If I tell it to Bala Hatun,
there would be war.

982
01:49:39,046 --> 01:49:43,325
I still came to you.

983
01:49:43,406 --> 01:49:48,445
If you have even a small amount
of reason, you would en these tricks.

984
01:49:49,206 --> 01:49:54,965
-Ulgen, you do not know anything.
-What I know is enough, Gonca.

985
01:49:55,846 --> 01:50:02,365
If you do not end it, I will
talk with Shahzade Alaeddin.

986
01:50:02,686 --> 01:50:08,285
-No.
-This is my last word.

987
01:50:09,006 --> 01:50:12,845
No, Ulgen.

988
01:50:13,326 --> 01:50:19,525
Ulgen. What will I do?

989
01:50:19,846 --> 01:50:22,685
Come here, come!

990
01:50:23,566 --> 01:50:26,605
Come on now.

991
01:50:43,286 --> 01:50:48,285
Master, take care as always.
-Be careful.

992
01:51:19,486 --> 01:51:21,965
You would die without me, Mehmed Bey!

993
01:51:22,046 --> 01:51:26,045
You envy me! You go wherever I go, Orhan Bey!

994
01:51:26,286 --> 01:51:28,765
Alps, come on

995
01:51:37,206 --> 01:51:43,205
Alps, be careful! Good
luck! Hit them for Allah!

996
01:53:59,046 --> 01:54:01,925
Vasilis!

997
01:54:05,806 --> 01:54:09,125
Orhan...

998
01:54:09,846 --> 01:54:14,165
I will take your heart out as
the price of my brother's blood.

999
01:54:14,366 --> 01:54:19,365
My father took your brother's head.
You will die just like your brother!

1000
01:54:39,366 --> 01:54:44,165
Aysima, what are you doing here?

1001
01:54:45,486 --> 01:54:50,565
Speak. What are you doing here?

1002
01:54:51,566 --> 01:54:55,165
You invited me.

1003
01:55:01,286 --> 01:55:04,125
Liar.

1004
01:55:05,566 --> 01:55:08,245
-She's lying!
-Holofira.

1005
01:55:08,566 --> 01:55:12,085
Aysima, answer me. Is
Holofira telling the truth?

1006
01:55:12,126 --> 01:55:14,805
What are you doing here?

1007
01:55:15,046 --> 01:55:17,685
Stop despising Holofira.

1008
01:55:17,846 --> 01:55:20,805
What are you talking about, Saadet Hatun?

1009
01:55:21,886 --> 01:55:24,285
Nobody despises anyone.

1010
01:55:24,486 --> 01:55:27,525
I won't let you insult Holofira anymore.

1011
01:55:27,686 --> 01:55:32,165
Saadet Hatun, don't make things harder.

1012
01:55:32,326 --> 01:55:38,725
We aren't insulting Holofira. We're just trying
to find out why Holofira slapped Aysima.

1013
01:55:40,046 --> 01:55:44,405
If you are looking
for a reason...

1014
01:55:55,966 --> 01:55:59,605
Holofira is even ashamed of talking about it.

1015
01:56:02,286 --> 01:56:05,965
The one who started this was Aysima.

1016
01:56:09,286 --> 01:56:13,725
Aysima, what is this? What did you do?

1017
01:56:13,886 --> 01:56:18,325
Let's see you can defend Aysima now, Malhun.

1018
01:56:23,166 --> 01:56:30,085
Stop. What you have done
doesn't suit our house, girl.

1019
01:56:30,606 --> 01:56:34,485
We're done with you.

1020
01:57:29,406 --> 01:57:32,485
My Shahzade!

1021
01:57:47,086 --> 01:57:49,765
Gurbuz!

1022
01:58:04,086 --> 01:58:08,565
-Gurbuz!
-Gurbuz!

1023
01:58:12,286 --> 01:58:16,765
How could you stand against me, Little Man?

1024
01:58:17,206 --> 01:58:19,525
This is the death blow!

1025
01:58:49,526 --> 01:58:53,005
Celali, let Osman Bey know!

1026
01:58:53,086 --> 01:58:57,045
-No, my Bey! I won't leave you!
-Go!

1027
01:59:12,766 --> 01:59:18,925
The new governor of Konya seems so cruel.

1028
01:59:19,806 --> 01:59:22,685
He will cause many troubles for us.

1029
01:59:23,246 --> 01:59:26,565
This land has seen many cruel people.

1030
01:59:26,966 --> 01:59:29,605
None of them could stand here.

1031
01:59:30,046 --> 01:59:34,085
He will also lose his head soon.

1032
01:59:35,326 --> 01:59:39,925
Battle can't be won by talking.

1033
01:59:41,606 --> 01:59:45,165
We don't even know who he is.

1034
01:59:45,446 --> 01:59:49,805
As soon as he came, he worked with Crusaders.

1035
01:59:50,206 --> 01:59:54,245
He organized a caravan. Did you know that?

1036
01:59:57,366 --> 02:00:02,805
And Osman Bey who is crying
for battles hasn't been around!

1037
02:00:12,446 --> 02:00:13,965
Peace be upon you.

1038
02:00:14,206 --> 02:00:17,165
-Peace be upon you.
-Peace be upon you, too.

1039
02:00:19,086 --> 02:00:22,245
Where have you been, Osman Bey?

1040
02:00:23,526 --> 02:00:26,005
We're struggling with troubles.

1041
02:00:26,246 --> 02:00:32,245
But Osman Bey who talks about
armies and battles isn't around!

1042
02:00:34,646 --> 02:00:38,925
Do you even want us to
fight beside you, Osman Bey?

1043
02:00:39,646 --> 02:00:44,685
You don't know about the
caravan or anything else.

1044
02:00:45,486 --> 02:00:50,085
Osman Bey... You have
an explanation, I hope.

1045
02:00:58,046 --> 02:01:02,285
-Boran.
-My Bey.

1046
02:01:07,846 --> 02:01:11,165
I held the caravan!

1047
02:01:14,326 --> 02:01:19,485
I broke Crusaders.
I hit Mongolians!

1048
02:01:26,486 --> 02:01:32,125
While you were chatting in the
council, I set up the battle council!

1049
02:01:35,966 --> 02:01:40,605
Here is the horseman.

1050
02:01:50,646 --> 02:01:55,405
-Horseman?
-Yes, horseman.

1051
02:01:57,846 --> 02:02:03,485
Karacelasun is the new governor of Konya.

1052
02:02:07,806 --> 02:02:10,245
We all know Karacelasun.

1053
02:02:10,366 --> 02:02:14,845
He's not a man to rule from the throne.

1054
02:02:16,646 --> 02:02:20,405
The war I have been crying for...

1055
02:02:21,526 --> 02:02:24,165
...is at our gates now.

1056
02:02:28,206 --> 02:02:31,645
May Allah bless our fight.

1057
02:02:32,686 --> 02:02:37,205
-May Allah bless it.
-May Allah bless it.

1058
02:02:40,006 --> 02:02:42,085
Beys.

1059
02:02:44,526 --> 02:02:47,845
If we do what I say

1060
02:02:50,246 --> 02:02:54,045
...we will be the winner with Allah's will.

1061
02:02:56,166 --> 02:03:01,525
But if you follow Sultan instead,

1062
02:03:04,686 --> 02:03:07,685
...we will be annihilated then.

1063
02:03:49,446 --> 02:03:52,925
While the matter was so tough

1064
02:03:53,526 --> 02:03:56,805
...we pushed you too hard, Osman Bey.

1065
02:03:59,606 --> 02:04:03,045
Unlike some,

1066
02:04:04,406 --> 02:04:08,965
...you did your part properly.

1067
02:04:11,366 --> 02:04:14,725
Forgive me, Osman Bey.

1068
02:04:18,926 --> 02:04:23,165
Osman Bey will forgive, Beys.

1069
02:04:23,246 --> 02:04:27,885
But let us not make further mistakes.

1070
02:04:28,086 --> 02:04:34,005
Everything is clear, we will fight.

1071
02:04:37,686 --> 02:04:40,605
You want holy war, is that so, Osman Bey?

1072
02:04:40,726 --> 02:04:44,405
I live for holy war, Yakup Bey.

1073
02:04:44,726 --> 02:04:48,485
Who are you going to fight?

1074
02:04:48,686 --> 02:04:53,165
The current situation is clear.

1075
02:04:56,326 --> 02:04:59,725
Let Karesi Bey stand behind you.

1076
02:05:00,006 --> 02:05:03,965
Let Felekuddin Bey stand behind you.

1077
02:05:05,806 --> 02:05:10,005
Let Suleyman Bey stand behind you.

1078
02:05:10,166 --> 02:05:16,885
All of you combined are not
even half the size of my army.

1079
02:05:22,646 --> 02:05:28,685
We will distribute the
swords we have to the people.

1080
02:05:28,766 --> 02:05:34,085
Everyone who can hold a
sword will stand behind us.

1081
02:05:35,206 --> 02:05:39,125
So you say that

1082
02:05:39,366 --> 02:05:44,365
you will move towards death
with the Beys and with people.

1083
02:05:46,086 --> 02:05:51,605
You cannot resist without Germiyan's alps.

1084
02:05:51,886 --> 02:05:58,925
Then it would be a glorious
ending for us, Yakup Bey.

1085
02:06:07,686 --> 02:06:11,445
It will not be an end.

1086
02:06:11,726 --> 02:06:16,045
It will be a new beginning.

1087
02:06:17,246 --> 02:06:22,725
I will give Germiyan Alps under your command.

1088
02:06:28,486 --> 02:06:35,685
If you want holy war, I will give it to you.

1089
02:06:36,766 --> 02:06:40,645
Just like Tugrul Bey and Cagri Bey.

1090
02:06:40,966 --> 02:06:45,645
Just like Bilge Kagan and Kul Tigin.

1091
02:06:46,406 --> 02:06:50,325
The throne and council will be mine,

1092
02:06:50,566 --> 02:06:55,085
the holy war and hunt will be yours.

1093
02:06:59,206 --> 02:07:06,685
The army will be formed, Osman
Bey. You will lead the army.

1094
02:07:07,446 --> 02:07:12,325
This is what the Sultan will give you.

1095
02:07:16,526 --> 02:07:22,445
If you say otherwise and
say that you will be the Sultan,

1096
02:07:22,686 --> 02:07:28,885
all of the Beys will doubt your sincerity.

1097
02:07:31,846 --> 02:07:37,085
And I will crush you.

1098
02:08:05,406 --> 02:08:08,005
No.

1099
02:08:21,166 --> 02:08:25,205
I would have accepted your offer

1100
02:08:26,606 --> 02:08:30,765
if I hadn't gotten this bad news.

1101
02:08:37,766 --> 02:08:39,485
But...

1102
02:08:44,606 --> 02:08:48,205
The hunt is mine

1103
02:08:49,246 --> 02:08:53,805
and the council is mine.

1104
02:08:59,606 --> 02:09:02,565
And even

1105
02:09:03,606 --> 02:09:09,165
if it's not enough, I'll kill you too.

1106
02:10:00,806 --> 02:10:03,445
Brother.

1107
02:10:25,766 --> 02:10:30,405
My Shahzade.

1108
02:10:30,686 --> 02:10:34,325
Give me your pardon.

1109
02:10:39,926 --> 02:10:44,805
May my Rabb make you glorious.

1110
02:10:45,286 --> 02:10:46,525
No.

1111
02:10:49,246 --> 02:10:54,085
Gurbuz Alp, hang on. Gurbuz Alp.

1112
02:10:54,206 --> 02:10:56,125
No.

1113
02:10:56,326 --> 02:11:01,275
I bear witness that there is none
worthy of worship but Allah,

1114
02:11:01,275 --> 02:11:04,735
and Muhammad (PBUH) is His Prophet.

1115
02:11:23,006 --> 02:11:29,685
"Indeed, we belong to Allah,
and indeed, to Him we return."

1116
02:11:55,206 --> 02:11:59,125
Alaeddin.

1117
02:12:02,966 --> 02:12:05,885
Alaeddin.

1118
02:12:14,166 --> 02:12:21,605
My Allah, my Allah help us. Give us strength.

1119
02:12:28,686 --> 02:12:34,445
Osman Bey, what are you doing, Osman Bey?

1120
02:12:35,646 --> 02:12:39,605
Osman wants power, Suleyman Bey.

1121
02:12:39,966 --> 02:12:45,245
Osman wants sultanate.

1122
02:12:45,526 --> 02:12:47,725
He doesn't care about holy war or battle.

1123
02:12:47,846 --> 02:12:50,325
Shut up!

1124
02:12:54,086 --> 02:12:58,085
Shut your mouth, Yakup Bey!

1125
02:12:58,806 --> 02:13:02,205
I gave Vasilis to you to kill him.

1126
02:13:02,726 --> 02:13:09,805
But you use him to bargain with the infidels.

1127
02:13:16,126 --> 02:13:23,045
That's right, I'll destroy
them all with the exchange.

1128
02:13:23,286 --> 02:13:28,725
Alps are prepared. I'll ruin them all.

1129
02:13:28,806 --> 02:13:31,845
You couldn't do it.

1130
02:13:32,086 --> 02:13:35,965
We were ruined, they attacked us.

1131
02:13:36,206 --> 02:13:40,565
They killed our Alps. Your son Mehmed...

1132
02:13:41,246 --> 02:13:45,285
...my son Orhan are

1133
02:13:45,366 --> 02:13:48,525
in the jaws of the infidels because of you.

1134
02:13:53,246 --> 02:13:57,205
I did it to capture their leader.

1135
02:13:57,406 --> 02:14:00,965
Now Vasilis is alive.

1136
02:14:01,446 --> 02:14:05,525
You traded the lives of my Alps

1137
02:14:05,606 --> 02:14:10,085
for the life of Vasilis.

1138
02:14:11,646 --> 02:14:15,805
-Mehmed.
-Look.

1139
02:14:16,366 --> 02:14:22,405
Look at me! You let the enemy escape.

1140
02:14:22,646 --> 02:14:26,365
They let them get
stronger, as if it's not enough

1141
02:14:26,446 --> 02:14:30,165
the blood of Alps and sons was spilled.

1142
02:14:32,926 --> 02:14:34,885
Now tell me.

1143
02:14:36,406 --> 02:14:39,525
What should I do to you,
Yakup Bey?

1144
02:14:50,904 --> 02:15:00,604
Visit turkision.com for more!